+
+<h1>PiP FEASIBILITY TEST</h1>
+<div class="sub">
+  Not part of the app — a throwaway page that answers one question:
+  <b>does a floating window keep updating after you leave the app?</b>
+  Android can only float a <code>&lt;video&gt;</code>, so the timer is drawn to a
+  canvas and streamed into one. If the numbers freeze when you switch away, the
+  web route is dead and the mini-player needs the native wrapper.
