+  <div class="row"><span>Document PiP (whole DOM)</span><span id="docpip">—</span></div>
+  <div class="row"><span>Video PiP (Android route)</span><span id="vidpip">—</span></div>
+  <div class="row"><span>Seconds spent hidden</span><span id="hidden">0.0</span></div>
+  <div class="row"><span>Timer ticks while hidden</span><span id="ticks">0</span></div>
+  <div class="row"><span>Canvas frames while hidden</span><span id="frames">0</span></div>
+  <div class="row"><span>rAF frames while hidden</span><span id="raf">0</span></div>
